[ceiling] Underside of the pan's 4 mm projecting rim flange. The 2.5 mm flange is the retaining shoulder captured by the enclosure sleeve. The pan prints floor down; removable support beneath the externally exposed flange is accessible on the loose pan. Supported clearance is allocated to the sleeve's mating floors and roof so the pan retains its flange section.
